Troubleshooting Tips
Issue: Script fails with permission denied

Solution: Ensure you're running scripts with sudo or as root user
Verify script has execute permissions with chmod +x script.sh
Issue: UFW blocks SSH connection

Solution: Always allow SSH before enabling UFW: sudo ufw allow 22/tcp
Keep a backup connection open when testing firewall rules
Issue: Services fail to restart after configuration

Solution: Test configuration syntax before restarting (e.g., sshd -t for SSH)
Check logs in /var/log/ for specific error messages
Restore backup configuration files if needed
Issue: AIDE initialization takes too long

Solution: AIDE database initialization can take 10-30 minutes on first run
Run in background or schedule during maintenance window
Consider excluding large directories like /var/log from monitoring
